---

knowledge-graph.json in this directory is generated data (a structural map of
this repository's own source: files, functions, imports, architecture layers,
guided tour) produced by running Understand-Anything's analysis pipeline
against micro-saas-studio-builder. It is not part of Understand-Anything
itself and carries no license claim beyond this project's own.
